  "description": "Twenty-year-old 'Ye-eun' dates handsome 'Jung-hyeon' and burns up her youth in her 20s\n\nAt the age of 30, he broke up with Jung-hyeon due to the reality of marriage.\n\nTwo years later, Ye-eun receives a wedding invitation from her co-worker 'Seon-mi' with Jeong-hyeon's name on it...\n\nShould I blush alone in the same workplace?\n\nJust when her loneliness grows bigger than she noticed, handsome men start appearing in front of Ye-eun one by one.\n\nYe-eun is confused between her ex-boyfriend's best friend 'Se-jin' and her younger brother 'Jin-han'. ...By the way, Junghyun still likes me?\n\nWhat will Ye-eun's relationship look like when she starts over at the age of 32?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \nR15: [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%82%B4-%EB%82%A8%EC%9E%90%EC%9D%98-%EC%B2%AD%EC%B2%A9%EC%9E%A5/3480), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/61770596)  \nR19: [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%82%B4-%EB%82%A8%EC%9E%90%EC%9D%98-%EC%B2%AD%EC%B2%A9%EC%9E%A5-19%EC%84%B8-%EC%99%84%EC%A0%84%ED%8C%90/3942), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/63529460)\n\n**Official Translations:**    \nR15: [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/181580)     \nR19: [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/181581)",
